            "headingtext_gncsc1mpils_html": "\nProtect Your Family with One of The Best Water Filtering System.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "Health Protection",
            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "Waterborne contaminants such as bacteria, viruses, heavy metals, and chemicals can lead to various health issues, including gastrointestinal problems, skin irritations, and long-term diseases.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle1_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "Environmental Benefits",
            "ecomiconlistdes_1_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "By using a water filtration system, you reduce the need for bottled water, which helps decrease plastic waste and its environmental impact.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle2_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "Long-Term Savings",
            "ecomiconlistdes_2_ecombe2zkav65ne_be2zkav65ne_html": "While there is an initial investment in purchasing and installing a water filtration system, it can save you money in the long run by reducing the need for bottled water and potential healthcare costs related to waterborne illnesses.",
            "headingtext_fs6hsl87qho_html": "A Trusted Name In&nbsp;<div>Gravity Water Filter Industry<\/div>",
            "title0_xqtps9shsv_html": "Maxium Purity",
            "text0_xqtps9shsv_html": "Due to the importance of water in our life we give 99.99% pure water to our customers.",
            "title1_xqtps9shsv_html": "2 Steps Filtration",
            "text1_xqtps9shsv_html": "ater has different types of impurity. 2 steps filtration removes all the impurity of the water.",
            "title2_xqtps9shsv_html": "Cholorine Free",
            "text2_xqtps9shsv_html": "We serve our water chlorine free to think about clients' lives since chlorine causes serious damage to our health.",
            "title3_xqtps9shsv_html": "Quality Certified",
            "text3_xqtps9shsv_html": "Our water quality is certified in several countries due to the purity of the water.",
            "headingtext_9e6rokyudts_html": "We Always Want Safe&nbsp;<div>and Healthy Water for a&nbsp;<\/div><div>Healthy Life.<\/div>",
            "textcontent_5oi1cyskjln_html": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.",
            "textcontent_5gmz2nrdr8i_html": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.",
            "headingtext_ahuas6hj505_html": "Frequently Asked Questions",
            "itemtitle0_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "What's in the box?",
            "itemtitle1_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "How does the 100-day Trial work?",
            "itemtitle2_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "How does the Phoenix Gravity retain the minerals in the water?",
            "itemtitle3_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "How does this compare with RO systems? Is it better than an RO?",
            "itemtitle4_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "What happens when the Phoenix Carbon purification cartridge gets clogged?",
            "itemtitle5_bhwgcp7e7od_html": "Which capacity should you choose?",
            "textcontent_34nma4tdfsv_html": "<ul><li>1 x Stainless Steel Upper Chamber<\/li><li><div>1 x Stainless Steel Lower Chamber<br><\/div><\/li><li><div>1 x Stainless Steel Lid<br><\/div><\/li><li><div>2 x Phoenix Carbon purification&nbsp;<br><\/div><\/li><li><div>1 x Knob with screw and washer&nbsp;<br><\/div><\/li><li><div>1 x SS Tap (Food-grade)&nbsp;<br><\/div><\/li><li><div>1 x Rubber Anti-Slip Base Ring&nbsp;<br><\/div><\/li><li><div>2 x pre-fitted Silicone Blockers to plug extra filter ports cartridges&nbsp;<\/div><\/li><\/ul><div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_ct7m29f2di9_html": "<ul><li>Purchase the Phoenix Gravity Water Filter system<\/li><li>Use the Phoenix Gravity Water filter system for up to 100 days.<\/li><li>If it doesn't produce the best water that you've been expecting, send it back to us for a full refund, no questions asked.<\/li><li>Return with original packaging and all parts. Steel housing should not be dented. Cartridges should not be cracked or broken.<br><\/li><\/ul>",
            "textcontent_bkplt3b7qwg_html": "The main advantage of the Phoenix Gravity\u2019s purification technology is that it filters only the harmful contaminants in your water \u2013 such as pathogenic bacteria, viruses and cysts, and chemical contaminants such as Chlorine, Lead, Heavy Metals, VOCs, Pesticides, while letting the naturally present mineral substances such as sodium, potassium, calcium and other minerals intact.",
            "textcontent_sbvvepj4l6e_html": "For almost all households with tap water, using an RO is unnecessary and not recommended as it wastes more than half of your water. An RO system strips away your water not only of harmful contaminants, but also removes minerals that are beneficial for your body. The Phoenix Gravity is perfect for purifying water with a TDS of less than 250. For water with TDS greater than 750, which is usually the case only with water from deep borewells, an RO system is recommended.",
            "textcontent_molci3mrvgd_html": "As you keep using the cartridges, their filtration rate may become awfully slow and inconvenient, if their pores are clogged, or if they dry out. This can be anywhere between 3 months to a year depending on the input water. To clean the cartridges, remove them from the upper chamber, making sure that unfiltered water does not spill into the lower chamber. Scrub each cartridge under running tap water using a soft brush or a mild abrasive. Always brush away from threaded mount, taking care not to contaminate the mount. Never use soap or detergents.",
            "textcontent_ba8zkpqusm9_html": "The most common capacities our customers prefer, based on the size of their household are as below:<div><ul><li>6-Litre - For up to 2 people&nbsp;<\/li><li>8-Litre \u2013 For up to 4 people&nbsp;<\/li><li>12-Litre \u2013 For up to 6 people<br><\/li><\/ul><\/div>"
        },
