            "textcontent_21o5ex9rkw6j_html": "<ul><li>The Phoenix Gravity System is easy to set up for \nany countertop in your home or workplace, no \nplumber or electricity required.<\/li><li>Housed in 304-grade stainless steel, naturally \nBPA-free and non-leaching.<\/li><li>&nbsp;Activated carbon filters made out from the \nhighest grade coconut shells (CTC 60) and infused \nwith silver to remove 99.99% contaminants and \npreserve the nutrients your body needs.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "textcontent_fcg8fvq2dfd_html": "<ul><li>20 x more powerful than a typical jug or those using granular carbon. Several times denser, with an extended filtration contact time and a &lt;1 micron rating they are 20 x more effective.<\/li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the \nmost effective, sustainable and durable filtration on \nthe market.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "headingtext_oz8n4z82l8p_html": "Designed for durability",
            "textcontent_0ioshksnajgv_html": " <ul><li>Unlike plastic filters, Phoenix Gravity\u2019s 304 \nstainless steel housing won\u2019t leach polyurethane, \nmicroplastics or harmful chemicals into your \nwater over time.<\/li><li>Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of \neveryday use for 10+ years<\/li><li>The hand polishing is done with the highest attention to detail to ensure quality, rivaling that of car manufacturers.<br><\/li><\/ul>",
            "headingtext_k2jw027lbz_html": "5-minute assembly",
            "textcontent_wlzx5bcwzy_html": " <ul><li>Install your Phoenix Gravity in 5 minutes or less.<\/li><li>It is easy to assemble.<br><\/li><li>No tools are required.<br><\/li><li>Just use your hands.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "headingtext_iohha6qpq7n_html": "5-minute assembly",
            "textcontent_wbyethv4nvb_html": " <ul><li>Install your Phoenix Gravity in 5 minutes or less.<\/li><li>It is easy to assemble.<br><\/li><li>No tools are required.<br><\/li><li>Just use your hands.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "headingtext_xos7yqho0p_html": "How Smart Carbon Cartridges work? ",
            "textcontent_er8kny6q4b_html": " <ul><li>Our Smart Carbon Cartridges rely on mechanical filtration method. The dense porous wall captures physical contaminants like microplastics, sediments, bacteria, cysts and other physical impurities. <\/li><li>By way of adsorption, chemical contaminants like chlorine, PFAS, pesticides, and many other chemical molecules get adhered to the surface of the activated carbon. <br><\/li><\/ul>",
            "textcontent_2syahtvqe8x_html": " <ul><li>Our activated coconut carbon cartridges filter\nwater for all your drinking and cooking needs.<\/li><li>Designed for longevity- our\ncartridges last up to 12 months. <br><\/li><li>This means fewer replacements and lower cost\nper litre. <br><\/li><li>We use a touch of silver to prevent bacteria re-growth- one of the\nmost common problems with traditional filters.<br><\/li><\/ul>",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom4lfld9snaje_4lfld9snaje_html": "Fresh, nutrient-rich water funnels from streams into public water systems.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomafavt2z2s9e_afavt2z2s9e_html": "It\u2019s exposed to contaminants including heavy metals, parasites, chemical waste, pesticides + more.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomoc9m0qa3ot_oc9m0qa3ot_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Filter purifies tap water through activated carbon cartridges made from the highest quality coconut shells",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomh16xlyqdmmn_h16xlyqdmmn_html": "The dense, porous wall removes 99.99% of contaminants - without altering your water\u2019s oxygen or mineral content.",
