        "ecom-about-us-page": {
            "headingtext_q0twiltxsc_html": "We're bringing<div><i><font color=\"#deb1b2\">water<\/font><\/i> back.<\/div>",
            "textcontent_v4wec6u1rj_html": "Advanced purification for straight-from-the-source hydration, wherever\nyou need it most",
            "headingtext_41cn3tmik0x_html": "Better <font color=\"#f0831f\">living<\/font><div>starts here<\/div>",
            "textcontent_voa5so9evz_html": "Sustainable, impurity-free and nutrient-rich water shouldn\u2019t be a luxury - it\u2019s a basic \nnecessity. When it comes to water, everyone \ndeserves a choice. And when it comes to \nhealth, we believe both people and the planet \ndeserve better.<div><div><br><\/div><\/div><div>That belief is what Phoenix Gravity water filters \nwere built on when it began, way back in 1978<br><\/div>",
            "headingtext_yiagphe7qg8_html": "Our story so far",
            "textcontent_7cb6rcmfq7_html": "Our story dates back to the late 1970s in both London, UK and \nChennai, India<b><\/b>",
            "textcontent_u0zj9ur7mxm_html": "In London, a soon-to-be-father was increasingly concerned \nabout the quality of tap water. Existing solutions were expensive, \ncomplicated, and not guaranteed to do the job. So, starting from \nscratch and leveraging innovative new technology, he designed\nand manufactured high-quality, low-waste drinking water filter \nceramics in the UK<b><\/b>",
            "textcontent_am6f3p0y52r_html": "Meanwhile in Chennai, another soon-to-be father saw an \nopportunity to manufacture water filters using the highest-grade stainless steel. So, he created a sustainable factory \n(run exclusively on solar power) to do just that. By 1985, it had \nbecome the go-to global supplier for 304 stainless steel water \nfilter housings.<div><b><\/b><\/div>",
            "textcontent_0qv068a7eje_html": "The two fathers joined forces in the early 2000s and by 2005, \nthe partnership blossomed to provide a unique combination of \nhigh-quality water filtration and manufacturing expertise.<div><b><\/b><\/div>",
            "textcontent_kjve2puag5f_html": "Years later their children, having worked in water filtration their \nwhole lives, decided to combine this expertise with their passion \nfor health and sustainability. Enter: Phoenix Gravity Water Filters.<div><div><\/div><div><b><\/b><\/div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_zzmth6g61k_html": "The highest-grade stainless steel gravity drinking water filtration\n\non the market, Phoenix Gravity Water Filters are bringing better-\ntasting, and better-nourishing water back to 800, 000+ * homes\n\nglobally (and counting!) - just as nature intended<div><div><\/div><div><b><\/b><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_wfaupmjnkpn_html": "Better quality you can taste, on tap.",
            "buttoncontent_3ako7ozao5d_html": "Yes please!",
            "headingtext_py9vakknw3m_html": "Our Mission",
            "textcontent_1yn3g4mpviu_html": "To help people live better by restoring water to its&nbsp;<div>&nbsp;straight-from-the-source purity, naturally.<\/div>",
            "headingtext_qoh5szpxoc_html": "We\u2019re dedicated to doing water better.",
            "buttoncontent_e8gssac6gzs_html": "Shop now",
            "headingtext_t2vg0c3urr_html": "<font color=\"#4994bf\">Better<\/font> for your body&nbsp;<div>(and mind)<div><\/div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_ymx7d91qpy_html": "<b><\/b>We remove 99.9% chlorine, bacteria, parasites, \nfluoride and other contaminants - without removing \nthe nutrients your body needs from magnesium, zinc, \npotassium and more.<div><div><div><b><\/b><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_ty6x1anuk4_html": "<font color=\"#4994bf\">Better<\/font> for the planet&nbsp;<div>(and your conscience)<div><\/div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_cgpmuku0r9k_html": "<b><\/b>We use the highest-grade stainless steel and \nenvironmentally-friendly materials and virtually \nzero plastic to maximise refills and minimise cost - \nleaving your water contaminant and guilt-free.<div><div><div><b><\/b><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_vg01y5i900b_html": "<font color=\"#4994bf\">Better<\/font> taste you can trust<div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_c9vx8qxcort_html": "<b><\/b>Better taste you can trust: With 40+ years of bringing \nwater back to its fresh-from-the-spring purity, we\u2019re \none of the largest manufacturers of gravity water \nfilters in the world.<div><div><div><b><\/b><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_7zn04k79edt_html": "<font color=\"#4994bf\"><\/font>The <font color=\"#4994bf\">best<\/font> way to filter<div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_bceiyqs2117_html": "<b><\/b>Our easy-to-install, multi-stage filtration fuses \nthe natural force of gravity with advanced design \nusing the highest grade stainless steel and coconut \ncarbon for the most effective and low maintenance \npurification on the market.<div><div><div><b><\/b><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_lfukgmm0tz_html": "Want to be the first to know about exclusive offers &amp; health news?",
            "buttoncontent_y9ykgxyyxul_html": "Yes please!",
            "headingtext_70g2vnogzi9_html": "Our people",
            "headingtext_secw89lv6k_html": "We\u2019re aiming to \nbring water back \nto everyone.",
            "textcontent_yzyklskey9s_html": "<div><br><\/div><div>Unsure if we sell in your region \nand what to find out?<br><\/div>",
            "buttoncontent_47vy6ig8n4e_html": "Yes please!",
            "headingtext_k1sxqxoh5gm_html": "Say hello to healthier hydration.",
            "buttoncontent_4qojdi7efny_html": "Shop",
            "buttoncontent_3dqimgbiqdy_html": "Shop",
            "buttoncontent_3h884yel0ji_html": "Shop"
        },
