            "title2_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Impregnated with silver to stop bacteria growth",
            "title3_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Less waste, fewer  refills, lower cost",
            "title4_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Better taste you can  trust for 40+ years",
            "headingtext_cvz8v5zrwif_html": "Product description:",
            "textcontent_21o5ex9rkw6j_html": "<ul><li>We\u2019ve created our Smart Cartridges from activated carbon using the highest-grade coconut shells (CTC 60) to create a dense, porous structure that removes 99.99% of parasites, heavy metals, chemicals and other contaminants - without removing the nutrients your body needs.<\/li><li>Traps physical contaminants more than 20 times smaller than jug filters.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "textcontent_fcg8fvq2dfd_html": "<ul><li>Our Smart Carbon Cartridges are highly dense, with a &lt;1 micron rating. They also have an extended filtration contact time. This makes them 20 x more powerful than typical jug filters and those using granular carbon.\n<br><\/li><li>Silver-impregnated to prevent bacteria growth keeping your water safer for longer.<\/li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the most effective, sustainable and durable filtration on the market.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "headingtext_7wggpvb2b3y_html": "Designed for durability",
            "textcontent_0ioshksnajgv_html": " <ul><li>Our activated carbon cartridges are designed for minimum replacement, and can last up to 20000 litre for pair.<\/li><li>Need replacing only once per year<br><\/li><\/ul>",
            "headingtext_xnuvkcmqr5_html": "Two-stage filtration at its finest",
            "textcontent_0efd9gkpdi6_html": "<b>Stage one: Tortuous Path<\/b><div>Activated carbon creatives a tortuous path that contaminants like microplastics, cysts and bacteria cannot pass through<div>Chemicals like chlorine, lead, pesticides and more are absorbed by activated surface&nbsp;<br><\/div><div><b>Stage Two: Sterilising&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div>Impregnated silver sterilises water and prevents growth of bacteria or mould<\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_037i333bcuod_html": "Better quality you can taste, on tap.",
            "buttoncontent_awcs2j2f8h_html": "Terms and conditions",
            "headingtext_j5rk9bbw2l_html": "Filtration At Its Finest",
            "headingtext_5kctelohsjo_html": "Removes 99.99% of harmful<div>contaminants<\/div>",
            "title0_7bivs8fk8r5_html": "Viruses",
            "text0_7bivs8fk8r5_html": "Can enter water via sewage systems and<div>animal waste and cause disease. <\/div>",
            "title0_hy0bfeafq_html": "Chlorine",
            "text0_hy0bfeafq_html": "Impacts the taste and smell of your&nbsp;<div>drinking water. <\/div>",
            "title0_j4et0rugxvl_html": "Bacteria",
            "text0_j4et0rugxvl_html": "Can contaminate water via septic systems&nbsp;<div>and sewers.<\/div>",
            "title0_d2jw17lpvmh_html": "Heavy metals",
            "text0_d2jw17lpvmh_html": "Can leach into drinking water from&nbsp;<div>household plumbing.<\/div>",
            "title0_oa9ltkt56km_html": "Parasites",
            "text0_oa9ltkt56km_html": "Can contaminate water through animal&nbsp;<div>waste and cause serious illness. <\/div>",
            "headingtext_bm6d3662m1n_html": "While protecting important&nbsp;<div>nutrients<\/div>",
            "title0_w1t4zjkxxx_html": "Calcium",
            "text0_w1t4zjkxxx_html": "Helps to strengthen bones<div>&nbsp;and teeth.<\/div>",
            "title0_uz5qhqt553_html": "Magnesium",
            "text0_uz5qhqt553_html": "Improves sleep and can help<div>&nbsp;strengthen muscles.<\/div>",
            "title0_l5yxtjwkju_html": "Potassium",
            "text0_l5yxtjwkju_html": "Can regulate nerve signals and improve&nbsp;<div>heart health.  <\/div>",
            "title0_ee6fm1p6lk6_html": "Chloride",
            "text0_ee6fm1p6lk6_html": "Helps to regulate and&nbsp;<div>nourish cells.  <\/div>",
            "title0_x3pfw88mn3k_html": "Sodium",
            "text0_x3pfw88mn3k_html": "Can balance water and<div>&nbsp;minerals   <\/div>",
            "headingtext_ej9r82f3z6w_html": "The Phoenix Difference",
            "textcontent_tluznympyp_html": "\nDesigned and manufactured in-house. Advanced and sustainable drinking water filtration removing 99.99% contaminants whilst retaining 100% nutrients.",
            "headingtext_n1ujbm1emyd_html": "Ready To Experience Water, As It Should Be?",
            "buttoncontent_bllo9g07igw_html": "Complete Purchase",
            "headingtext_b3vp7gkh1q_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water<div>Filter with Smart Carbon<\/div>",
            "headingtext_c0v77jocgde_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water<div>&nbsp;Filter with Smart Carbon + Fluoride Removal<div><div><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_tbmp00fdh4_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water Filter with Smart Carbon + Fluoride Removal + Teak Wood Stand<div><div><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_7r1lng6wjij_html": "FAQs",
            "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Are the activated carbon cartridges compatible with all gravity filters or just the \nPhoenix Gravity Filter?",
            "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I set it up myself?",
            "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I clean my carbon cartridges?",
            "item_title_3_obyhwb3w3en_html": "How does the Phoenix Gravity Filter compare to plastic jugs or other filters?",
            "textcontent_fxwrc56lf3f_html": "Yes! Our advanced Carbon Cartridges are compatible with all gravity filters including Berkey and Doulton. If you\u2019re not sure about your filter, just drop us a line and we\u2019ll be happy to assist you&nbsp;<a href=\"\/pages\/contact-us\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">contact here.<\/font><\/a><div><br><\/div>",
            "textcontent_icztbf9rrkg_html": "Absolutely. The carbon cartridges are easy to replace on your own - without tools or a professional - and installed in your Phoenix Gravity System within minutes.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>You simply remove the old cartridges from the upper chamber of your filter and replace them with the new. We\u2019ll send detailed assembly instructions with your new delivery - and our team is always available via chat, email and phone to provide help and support. <a href=\"\/pages\/contact-us\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">Contact here<\/font><\/a><div><div><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_o41lz187f0t_html": "Generally, you won\u2019t need to clean your cartridges - but they should be replaced within 18 months. If you notice the flow slows down, it may mean the cartridge is blocked. In this case, you can easily clean your filter in your home using tap water and a soft brush or mild abrasive. We\u2019ll include detailed instructions when we send it to you. <div><br><\/div>",
            "headingtext_6olks5fatnd_html": "Still have a burning question? See our full FAQs <a href=\"\/pages\/faq\">here.<\/a> ",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom9e4svd9679j_9e4svd9679j_html": "If you don\u2019t like your water filter within 100 days,  we\u2019ll give you a full refund.",
            "buttoncontent_ejg46scfpji_html": "Complete Purchase",
            "headingtext_7yt4sozijtk_html": "The Phoenix difference, straight from the source(s)."
        },
        "ecom-contact-us-page": {
            "headingtext_5wopn38z60i_html": "Want to get in touch? Drop us a line here.",
            "textcontent_qetuqrcyopl_html": "But first! The answer to your question(s) may already be \navailable on our website. Click below if you want to know about:",
            "item_title_0_xjuq3bq4xbm_html": "How to set up your water filter",
            "item_title_1_xjuq3bq4xbm_html": "How our filtration system works",
            "item_title_2_xjuq3bq4xbm_html": "What size filter is best for you",
            "item_title_3_xjuq3bq4xbm_html": "Our delivery and returns",
            "item_title_4_xjuq3bq4xbm_html": "Our 10 year warranty",
            "item_title_5_xjuq3bq4xbm_html": "Our 100-Day Money Back Guarantee",
            "textcontent_6pkheg8wxxg_html": "Certainly! Our systems are designed to be extremely easy to assemble and everything you need will be included. You can do it yourself with just your hands - there\u2019s no specialist tools, plumbers or electricians required.<div>We include full instructions with every unit and we\u2019re always here to help. You can contact us<a href=\"\/pages\/help-center\"> <font color=\"#f1d14e\">here.<\/font><\/a><\/div>",
            "textcontent_08z1bx1tyy8_html": "We use the highest grade 304 stainless steel, natural coconut carbon, premium ceramic\nand other natural materials. Plus the mighty force of gravity! Our advanced filtration\nsystem removes up to 99.99% of commonly occurring contaminants and retains up to\n100% of nutrients.<div><a href=\"\/pages\/our-technology\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">Click here<\/font><\/a> for more information on how it works.<br><div><a href=\"\/pages\/our-technology\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"><\/font><\/a><br><\/div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_th7rx6npocp_html": "This depends on how many people will be using your Phoenix Gravity Water Filter, and\nhow much water you drink! Generally, we recommend:<div>6-Litre - Perfect pairing, for up to 1-2 people&nbsp;<\/div><div>8-Litre - In the middle, for up to 2-4 people&nbsp;<\/div><div>12-Litre - Family friendly, for 3-4 + people<div><div><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_ihx5usc38bp_html": "We currently ship to the UK and all of Europe. Shipping times and cost depend on your\nspecific location, and will be calculated at the checkout.",
            "textcontent_1h9qv6gfzws_html": "We offer a 10 year warranty for our Stainless Steel Gravity Water Filter system\nhousings. They\u2019re made to last, so you\u2019re protected against any defects in material and\nworkmanship. For full T&amp;Cs, <a href=\"\/pages\/product-registration\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">click here.<\/font><\/a> <div><a href=\"\/pages\/product-registration\"><\/a><br><\/div>",
            "buttoncontent_cc38zitwj4m_html": "Shop now",
            "headingtext_86p8c7oooff_html": "Still have a burning question? We\u2019d love to hear from you.",
            "textcontent_syo57hq8bj_html": "For customer support, contact:<div><b>support@phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk<div>+4420 8058 5660<\/div><\/b><div><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_1w1jt0rk1m1_html": "Fill out the form below and we\u2019ll be in \ntouch within 48 hours."
        },
