            "hotspot_label0_gjo2a90pknr_html": "Teak wood stand",
            "textCard0_gjo2a90pknr_html": "<ul><li>Compatible with 6L and 8L Phoenix Water Filter Systems.<\/li><li><div>Supports up to 25kg.<\/div><\/li><\/ul><div><br><div><br><\/div><\/div>",
            "hotspot_label1_gjo2a90pknr_html": "Carbon Cartridges",
            "textCard1_gjo2a90pknr_html": "<ul><li>Removes 99.99% of harmful\r\ncontaminants<\/li><li><div>Activated high grade (CTC 60) Smart Carbon Cartridges<\/div><\/li><\/ul><div> <br><\/div>",
            "hotspot_label2_gjo2a90pknr_html": "POSTreat ",
            "textCard2_gjo2a90pknr_html": "<ul><li>Housed in 304 stainless steel<\/li><li><div>FluoRid media to remove more than 95% of fluoride<\/div><\/li><\/ul><div><br><div><br><\/div><\/div>",
            "hotspot_label3_gjo2a90pknr_html": "Phoenix Gravity Water Filter",
            "textCard3_gjo2a90pknr_html": "<div><\/div><ul><li><div>304-grade stainless steel housing unit <br><\/div><\/li><li><div>10 minute self-assembly. No tools needed.\r\n<br><\/div><\/li><\/ul><br>",
            "headingtext_yqwwu68iin_html": "Designed for perfection",
            "title0_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "304 stainless steel is light weight, rust-resistant, and durable",
            "text0_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "<br>",
            "title1_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "Dual filtration system filters up to 2.25 litre of water per hour",
            "text1_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "<br><div><div><\/div><\/div>",
            "title2_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "Removes 99.9% of parasites, contaminants and heavy metals",
            "text2_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "<br><div><div><\/div><\/div>",
            "title0_tjb8efyx5_html": "Drip-free metal tap dispenses delicious-tasting water",
            "text0_tjb8efyx5_html": "<br><div><div><\/div><\/div>",
