            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecomhzb679gfmw_hzb679gfmw_html": "Test report for removal of heavy metals",
            "headingtext_9rb1axyr1qk_html": "The most convenient and affordable way to enjoy pure, clean drinking in your home",
            "buttoncontent_717wxjfsrey_html": "Try it Risk - Free For 100 Days",
            "textcontent_fhmm058j13d_html": "Enjoy Safe, Delicious Drinking Water in 2 Minutes-Quick To set Up Easy To Clean, And \u00a3787.34s Cheaper Than Bottles Or An In-Home System!",
            "title0_cx7zb4w02jp_html": "100-day risk-free trial",
            "text0_cx7zb4w02jp_html": "Worried the Phoenix Gravity Water Filter is too good to be true? Don't believe it will really remove as many contaminants as we promise?<div><br><div>We stand behind our product 100% - so you can trial our filter in your own home for 100 days risk-free. If you aren't fully satisfied with the purity of your water, send it back within 100 days for a full refund, no questions asked!<br><\/div><\/div><div>*T&amp;Cs apply<br><\/div>",
            "headingtext_hisorkjtx3j_html": "Drink crystal-clean, great-testing\nwater in 3 easy steps!",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Assemble Your Filter",
            "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Simply follow the instructions included in the box to put together your filter - it's super easy to set up and only takes 2 minutes.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle1_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Add Tap Water",
            "ecomiconlistdes_1_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Take off the lid and pour in tap water. The dual filters use natural kiln-fired ceramic filtration from the southern province of Spain to remove toxins.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle2_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Safe To Drink!",
            "ecomiconlistdes_2_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Pour yourself a glass -you'll notice a clean, crisp taste you only get from filtered water that's had all the nasty chemicals removed!",
            "headingtext_x9pk2ai3y7f_html": "Try the phoenix risk-free\nfor 100 days",
            "textcontent_ys4k82ekbw_html": "We are confident in the transformative power of the Phoenix Gravity Water Filter. Hence, we offer a 100-day risk-free trial. It's not just a product: it's a commitment to your well-being and satisfaction.",
            "headingtext_ysteolvwfil_html": "Here's what's included:",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomdt400b7nux_dt400b7nux_html": "1x Stainless Steel Housing Unit",
            "ecomiconlisttitle1_ecomdt400b7nux_dt400b7nux_html": "2 x Carbon Filter Cartridges ",
