            "text0_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\u201cWe were looking for a solid filter that would be easy to maintain, easy to build, long lasting, and effective. Meets the mark on all accounts!\"",
            "name0_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Andrew Narduzzi",
            "text1_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\u201cHad this for a few months. It works brilliantly. Haven't had to replace the filters yet. Quality is definitely good enough.\r\n\u201d",
            "name1_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Last of The Meketrex Supplicants",
            "text2_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\u201cWell made unit, easy to assemble, reasonable rate of filtration, good value for money compared to other granular activated carbon filters.\u201d",
            "name2_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Gary D",
