        "ecom-our-tech-page": {
            "headingtext_pbl7pxzij7_html": "Welcome back to water",
            "textcontent_7qbupvoyq8v_html": "At Phoenix Gravity Water Filters, we\u2019ve harnessed decades of innovation to bring you the purest drinking water.&nbsp;",
            "marquee_text0_7ifwlcyvjse_html": "Free UK delivery over \u00a399",
            "marquee_text1_7ifwlcyvjse_html": "10 year warranty",
            "marquee_text2_7ifwlcyvjse_html": "Up to 99.9% contaminants removed",
            "marquee_text3_7ifwlcyvjse_html": "100 day money back guarantee",
            "headingtext_k736wwz02jk_html": "Engineered to eliminate contaminants",
            "textcontent_5a1xti0soxm_html": "Removes up to 99.9% of contaminants for clean, safe and healthy water.",
            "headingtext_r6h7l9g5yt_html": "Mineral-rich water preserving the good",
            "textcontent_d6nopws3eem_html": "Advanced 5-micron absolute-rated filters efficiently removes over 99% of particulate matter while retaining vital minerals, delivering truly wholesome drinking water.",
            "headingtext_eh0hh7rw95u_html": "Mineral-rich water preserving the good",
            "textcontent_e6qglleavaw_html": "Advanced 5-micron absolute-rated filters efficiently removes over 99% of particulate matter while retaining vital minerals, delivering truly wholesome drinking water.",
            "headingtext_87gvwza7cbk_html": "The Science Behind Phoenix Gravity\nWater Filters",
            "textcontent_9cz2kqdv1a_html": "We're passionate about providing you with the cleanest, healthiest drinking water possible. Our innovative filter system utilizes a multi-stage filtration process to remove a wide range of contaminants, leaving you with fresh, great-tasting water.",
            "headingtext_t8rxrxjwy4q_html": "The Science Behind Phoenix Gravity\nWater Filters",
            "textcontent_q19szg08kft_html": "We're passionate about providing you with the cleanest, healthiest drinking water possible. Our innovative filter system utilizes a multi-stage filtration process to remove a wide range of contaminants, leaving you with fresh, great-tasting water.",
            "headingtext_cpeq5j72diw_html": "Stage 1: Tortuous Path",
            "textcontent_g270mrl952t_html": "Activated carbon creates a tortuous path that captures impurities ensuring your water is clean.",
            "headingtext_g4b9ooy1txp_html": "Stage 2: Sterilising",
            "textcontent_lv2hm82542q_html": "In the second stage, the Impregnated silver kills bacteria and mold, ensuring fresh water.",
            "textcontent_1hv7c2s13te_html": "UNVEILING PURE HYDRATION",
            "headingtext_n8x4gjyapz9_html": "Understanding Water Purity Through Turmeric Test",
            "headingtext_3ymdrlo4jg5_html": "Experience Healthier Hydration",
            "textcontent_xv2kpbyl0o_html": "Our advanced filtration technology delivers pure, revitalizing water that can positively impact your overall well-being.&nbsp;",
            "headingtext_m0s32pvyjue_html": "<div>Cellular Regeneration<\/div>",
            "textcontent_xmfj0v30hhm_html": "Nourish your body from within and slow down the aging process.",
            "headingtext_jqkm2aylaq_html": "Optimal Sleep",
            "textcontent_jgjx00x54us_html": "Enjoy restful nights with adequate water intake that helps optimize your body's temperature regulation.",
            "headingtext_alqdneg9r1q_html": "Stronger Immune System",
            "textcontent_ckmlqklpldb_html": "Improves your blood flow and supports a healthier immune system.",
            "headingtext_813r0mhnp8h_html": "Enhanced Cognitive Function",
            "textcontent_74x602r0nen_html": "Water carries essential nutrients to your brain, supporting optimal cognitive function.",
            "textcontent_85k0u043jxx_html": "THE POSTREAT ADVANTAGE",
            "headingtext_dtgnhxft77i_html": "Go one step further for fluoride removal",
            "headingtext_ac17ie35rt_html": "Efficient",
            "textcontent_48bb71f3iex_html": "Our advanced POSTreat filter provides over 95% fluoride removal for precise, targeted filtration.",
            "headingtext_vuj25t0rfq_html": "Perfectly Paired",
            "textcontent_zwhjv5qt49s_html": "Pairs seamlessly with Phoenix Gravity Carbon Filters, crafted from 100% pure coconut shells.",
            "headingtext_uxw9ym7ab1s_html": "Refillable",
            "textcontent_1zna6w68t7u_html": "Crafted from durable stainless steel and designed for sustainability, featuring refillable FluoRid media for an eco-friendly solution.",
            "headingtext_99qll8va6r_html": "<div>304-grade stainless steel<\/div>",
            "textcontent_x5vckgwgiti_html": "Naturally BPA-free and rust-resistant for locked-in freshness. Our premium grade stainless steel comes with a 10 year warranty.",
            "headingtext_zmv9ctb6ovn_html": "Highest-grade activated coconut carbon",
            "textcontent_1m4hoz4tv9e_html": "We use CT90 premium coconut carbon for our Smart Carbon Cartridges. We form it into a highly dense porous carbon block. This enables us to continue removing 99.99% of contaminants for at least 12 months.",
            "headingtext_xfi54bx8dfp_html": "20 x more powerful",
            "textcontent_7cpo16y8fm4_html": "Our Smart Carbon Cartridges have a &lt;1 micron rating and an extended filtration contact time. Making them 20 x more effective than typical jug filters and those using granular carbon.",
            "headingtext_5qd9irhgm6i_html": "Thought Leader Talks",
            "textcontent_gsxikfk0pv9_html": "Insights and innovations straight from industry leaders.",
            "headingtext_e8gv2st2qh_html": "Thought Leader Talks",
            "textcontent_9zirz2baoxi_html": "Insights and innovations straight from industry leaders.",
            "headingtext_ybt9841ka9_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water Filter with Smart Carbon &amp; Fluoride Removal",
            "headingtext_b1xrnm6cn_html": "Our PRODUCTS",
            "headingtext_dgqnjhmwqhc_html": "Don\u2019t just take our word for it, try it for yourself",
            "textcontent_ga98ym2kdg_html": "We highly recommend our best-selling system crafted with rust-resistant AISI 304 stainless steel, premium CTC-60 coconut carbon to remove up to 99.9% of contaminants, and our one-of-a-kind refillable POSTreat filters that reduce over 95% of fluoride.",
            "buttoncontent_9ugpsugf8jv_html": "Shop Now"
        },
