            "text1_hpxa3t0svqo_html": "Can contaminate water \r\nthrough animal waste and \r\ncause serious illness",
            "title2_hpxa3t0svqo_html": "and many more",
            "headingtext_9ce3rla4wna_html": "While <font color=\"#4994bf\">protecting<\/font> important \nminerals",
            "text0_wxolqz1d3vn_html": "Helps to \r\nstrengthen \r\nbones and teeth.",
            "text1_wxolqz1d3vn_html": "Improves sleep and \r\ncan help strengthen \r\nmuscles.",
            "headingtext_lsg9dljy6tc_html": "Here\u2019s how it happens.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom03x8rtw7537j_03x8rtw7537j_html": "Fresh, nutrient-rich water funnels from streams into public water systems.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomy6ptbw4krbq_y6ptbw4krbq_html": "It\u2019s exposed to contaminants  including heavy metals, parasites,  chemical waste, pesticides + more",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomp9nn9tgnyoo_p9nn9tgnyoo_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Filter purifies  tap water through activated carbon  cartridges made from the highest  quality coconut shells",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomsgfy8pvl59o_sgfy8pvl59o_html": "The dense, porous wall removes  99.99% of contaminants - without  altering your water\u2019s oxygen or  mineral content",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomjev1lfa4xx_jev1lfa4xx_html": "You and your loved ones enjoy fresh,  nutrient-rich water with ease - just  as nature intended.",
            "headingtext_x7iy6nag3sf_html": "Leaving you with healthier hydration",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomemdqpbm42dk_emdqpbm42dk_html": "Slows down ageing process by aiding cell regeneration",
