            "headingtext_1bnefp5teng_html": "Go one step further for \nfluoride removal:",
            "textcontent_g1yntgb21x4_html": "+&nbsp; Our additional POSTreat filter removes more than \t\t\n95% of fluoride for highly targeted filtration",
            "textcontent_jega850ejq_html": "+&nbsp; Works in tandem with Phoenix Gravity Filters made \nof 304 grade stainless steel",
            "textcontent_oufqa7u222h_html": "+&nbsp; Designed for maximum reuse, the first on the \nmarket with refillable environmentally-friendly materials",
            "headingtext_azr00hm4hbc_html": "Say hello to hydration, as it should be",
            "buttoncontent_gtg3uj62778_html": "Shop Now",
            "headingtext_94nflkrwmf6_html": "How the Phoenix Gravity Filter compares",
            "headingtext_qjhiidu1kk_html": "304-grade stainless steel",
            "textcontent_hc7mgwnl5jp_html": "Naturally BPA-free and rust-resistant for locked-in freshness. Our premium grade stainless steel comes with a 10 year warranty.",
            "headingtext_bexwhrni6r6_html": "Highest-grade activated coconut carbon",
            "textcontent_l4m5le4lval_html": "We use CT90 premium coconut carbon for our Smart Carbon Cartridges. We form it into a highly dense porous carbon block. This enables us to continue removing 99.99% of contaminants for at least 12 months. ",
            "headingtext_vpivbbtddf_html": "20 x more powerful",
            "textcontent_r7kg0jmpdan_html": "Our Smart Carbon Cartridges have a &lt;1 micron rating and an extended filtration contact time. Making them 20 x more effective than typical jug filters and those using granular carbon.",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomk5c3x6f4oo_k5c3x6f4oo_html": "100 day money back guarantee & 10 year warranty",
            "headingtext_0jzd00yno4sl_html": "We take our performance seriously.",
            "textcontent_a6yy95ufe9_html": "<h3>Our filters are independently tested and verified.<\/h3>",
