            "headingtext_7r1lng6wjij_html": "FAQs",
            "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Is The POSTtreat Compatible With All Gravity Filters Or Just The Phoenix Gravity Filter?",
            "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I set it up myself?",
            "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I Clean My POSTtreat Fluoride Filter?",
            "textcontent_fxwrc56lf3f_html": "The POSTreat is compatible with all gravity filtration systems. Remember, it can\u2019t be used alone - so you must have a gravity filtration system and existing Carbon Cartridge to use it.<div><br><\/div>",
            "textcontent_icztbf9rrkg_html": "Absolutely. The POSTtreat is designed for easy DIY set-up with your Phoenix Gravity System. \nYou simply attach your POSTtreat cartridges to the exposed threat of the Carbon Cartridges. We\u2019ll send detailed assembly instructions with your POSTreat filter.<div><div><br><\/div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_o41lz187f0t_html": "Yes, it\u2019s simple! You can clean the stainless steel casting of the POSTreat filter - without the FluoRid media inside - in your home using tap water and a soft brush or mild abrasive. The FluoRid media itself will need to be replaced every 4 months. We\u2019ll include detailed instructions when we send it to you.<div><br><\/div>",
            "headingtext_45y1mu0rgsl_html": "Still have a burning question? See our full FAQs <a href=\"\/pages\/faq\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">here.<\/font><\/a>",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom9e4svd9679j_9e4svd9679j_html": "If you don\u2019t like your water filter within 100 days, we\u2019ll give you a full refund.",
            "buttoncontent_ejg46scfpji_html": "Complete Purchase",
            "headingtext_7yt4sozijtk_html": "The Phoenix difference, straight from the source(s)."
        },
