            "textcontent_onvvwdx31a_html": "*Fluoride removal cartridge for drinking water, compatible with all Gravity Systems. Must be used in conjunction with a primary Phoenix Gravity Smart <a href=\"\/products\/smart-carbon-cartridges\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">Carbon Cartridges<\/font><\/a>, it\u2019s not a stand-alone.*",
