            "buttoncontent_y3w7rtreas_html": "Choose your catridges",
            "headingtext_cgaiktrtrpi_html": "A better way to drink water, naturally.",
            "text0_8ack06n0lqi_html": "If you don\u2019t like your water filter, within 100 days we\u2019ll give you a full refund.",
            "buttoncontent_s0wbbr81o6_html": "Return Policy",
            "headingtext_moe14bitija_html": "Your health can only be as good as your water.<div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_yhdbpi7fg1r_html": "We\u2019re always told to drink more water, but do you know what it actually does?<div><br><\/div><div>The quality of your water impacts the quality of your sleep, skin, hair, immunity, brain power, health - and much, much more. Your body is made up of 60% water you are what you drink.<br><\/div><div><div><div><div><br><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_rkhk2gau3pe_html": "But nutrient-rich, impurity-free water isn\u2019t always on tap.<div><\/div>",
            "headingtext_5whg2vchcbb_html": "What Phoenix Gravity Water Filters remove?",
            "name0_cjwfins9og7_html": "microplastics ",
            "title0_cjwfins9og7_html": "99%",
            "name1_cjwfins9og7_html": "heavy metals ",
            "title1_cjwfins9og7_html": "99.9%",
            "name2_cjwfins9og7_html": "PFAs",
            "title2_cjwfins9og7_html": "95%",
            "name3_cjwfins9og7_html": "pesticides",
            "title3_cjwfins9og7_html": "99%",
            "name4_cjwfins9og7_html": "giardia cysts",
            "title4_cjwfins9og7_html": "99.99%",
            "name5_cjwfins9og7_html": "Viruses",
            "title5_cjwfins9og7_html": "99.9%",
            "name6_cjwfins9og7_html": "Bacteria",
            "title6_cjwfins9og7_html": "99.999%",
            "name7_cjwfins9og7_html": "Parasites",
            "title7_cjwfins9og7_html": "99.9%",
            "name8_cjwfins9og7_html": "Chlorine",
            "title8_cjwfins9og7_html": "99%",
            "headingtext_mevk83v2cg_html": "Here\u2019s How It Works",
            "headingtext_jgoqkzp4vhm_html": "Better quality you can taste, on tap",
            "buttoncontent_76d19r2d2t_html": "Yes please!",
            "headingtext_vkmaqerxxy_html": "We\u2019re here for your hydration.",
            "textcontent_mxtgphkfi1_html": "We believe that  <b>great-tasting,  impurity-free <\/b>water \nis a basic right - not a privilege. As the world\u2019s leading manufacturer of gravity water flters, we\u2019re on a mission to make  <b>healthier hydration<\/b> accessible to everyone,<div><br><\/div><div>wherever they need it most.\nWe also happen to be one of the oldest kids on the \nblock, bringing water back to its straight-from-the-<b>\nsource purity<\/b> since 1978.<div><div><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
            "buttoncontent_byenycgxa9_html": "Read  Our Story",
            "headingtext_t0u1977v2h_html": "Say hello to hydration, as it should be.",
            "buttoncontent_52ih3ryffny_html": "Shop Now",
            "headingtext_4vucrif9yhu_html": "The Phoenix Difference",
            "headingtext_o09n267yws_html": "Straight from the source(s)",
            "text0_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\u201cWe were looking for a solid filter that would be easy to maintain, easy to build, long lasting, and effective. Meets the mark on all accounts!\"",
            "name0_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Andrew Narduzzi",
            "text1_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\u201cHad this for a few months. It works brilliantly. Haven't had to replace the filters yet. Quality is definitely good enough.\r\n\u201d",
            "name1_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Last of The Meketrex Supplicants",
            "text2_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\u201cWell made unit, easy to assemble, reasonable rate of filtration, good value for money compared to other granular activated carbon filters.\u201d",
            "name2_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Gary D",
            "text3_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\"So much better than i thought it would be. It looks really good, very sturdy, and the water is so soft. Wish id bought one years ago.\"",
            "name3_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Gilly K Edwards",
            "headingtext_8i6q4yzc5ai_html": "<u>Stay Connected.<\/u>"
        },
