            "headingtext_cvz8v5zrwif_html": "Product description:",
            "textcontent_21o5ex9rkw6j_html": "<ul><li>304-grade stainless steel tap, compatible with Phoenix Gravity Systems and other gravity systems.<\/li><li>Easy to fit to your filter within minutes.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "textcontent_fcg8fvq2dfd_html": "<ul><li>Easy-to-use, with a firm, drip-free handle to open and close.<\/li><li>Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of everyday use for 10+ years.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "textcontent_4a2do2mjlfg_html": "<ul><li>304-grade stainless steel tap, compatible with Phoenix Gravity Systems and other gravity systems.<\/li><li>Easy to fit to your filter within minutes.<\/li><li>Easy-to-use, with a firm, drip-free handle to open and close.<\/li><li>&nbsp;Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of everyday use for 10+ years.<br><\/li><\/ul>",
