            "view_more_text_r79fzbgcs7_html": "View more",
            "view_less_text_r79fzbgcs7_html": "View less",
            "marquee_text0_qblkv6vywwa_html": " 100 day money back guarantee",
            "marquee_text1_qblkv6vywwa_html": " Free delivery over \u00a399",
            "marquee_text2_qblkv6vywwa_html": " 99.99% contaminants removed",
            "textcontent_3ey66fncv7c_html": "Advanced and sustainable gravity filtration removes 99.99% of contaminants while retaining the nutrients your body needs.",
            "add_to_cart_q0w89xz74i_html": "ADD",
            "pre_order_q0w89xz74i_html": "Pre Order",
            "product_unavailable_q0w89xz74i_html": "Unavailable",
            "out_stock_q0w89xz74i_html": "Out stock",
            "added_cart_text_q0w89xz74i_html": "ADD",
            "added_cart_message_q0w89xz74i_html": "Added to cart",
            "headingtext_tewlld6ill_html": "Includes everything you need for advanced filtration:",
            "textcontent_0yff2xr1comb_html": "<ul><li>1 x 304-grade Stainless Steel housing unit<\/li><li>1 x Stainless Steel tap<br><\/li><li> 2 x Smart Carbon cartridges<\/li><\/ul><div><\/div> <div>\n<\/div>",
            "headingtext_a6trs2n2jv_html": "Optional extras:",
            "buttoncontent_bn66v9uyt3_html": "ADD",
            "buttoncontent_uep3rnm1vct_html": "ADD",
            "buttoncontent_1ol4fom7wcj_html": "ADD",
            "buttoncontent_pmg169qodp_html": "ADD",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomf34fru6hip5_f34fru6hip5_html": "10 year warranty ",
            "title0_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Retaines 100% nutrients",
            "title1_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "10 minute self-assembly",
            "title2_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Less waste, fewer refills, lower cost",
            "title3_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Better taste you can trust for 40+ years",
            "headingtext_cvz8v5zrwif_html": "Product description:",
            "textcontent_21o5ex9rkw6j_html": "<ul><li>The Phoenix Gravity System is easy to set up for \nany countertop in your home or workplace, no \nplumber or electricity required.<\/li><li>Housed in 304-grade stainless steel, naturally \nBPA-free and non-leaching.<\/li><li>&nbsp;Activated carbon filters made out from the \nhighest grade coconut shells (CTC 60) and infused \nwith silver to remove 99.99% contaminants and \npreserve the nutrients your body needs.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "textcontent_fcg8fvq2dfd_html": "<ul><li>20 x more powerful than a typical jug or those using granular carbon. Several times denser, with an extended filtration contact time and a &lt;1 micron rating they are 20 x more effective.<\/li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the \nmost effective, sustainable and durable filtration on \nthe market.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "headingtext_oz8n4z82l8p_html": "Designed for durability",
            "textcontent_0ioshksnajgv_html": " <ul><li>Unlike plastic filters, Phoenix Gravity\u2019s 304 \nstainless steel housing won\u2019t leach polyurethane, \nmicroplastics or harmful chemicals into your \nwater over time.<\/li><li>Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of \neveryday use for 10+ years<\/li><\/ul>",
            "textcontent_a3edtfaji5j_html": " <ul><li>Our activated coconut carbon cartridges filter \nwater for all your drinking and cooking needs<\/li><li>Designed for longevity- our cartridges last up to 12 months. This means fewer replacements and \nlower cost per litre<\/li><li>We use a touch of silver to prevent bacteria \nre-growth- one of the most common problems \nwith traditional filters<br><\/li><\/ul>",
            "headingtext_e2cv63xjt4k_html": "How our technology works",
            "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomwx6prxol82a_wx6prxol82a_html": "Fresh, nutrient-rich water funnels from streams into public water systems.",
