            "textcontent_akfntgc60wj_html": "<ul><li>Purchase the Phoenix Gravity system.<\/li><li>Use the system for full 100 days.<\/li><li>If you don't get the best tasting water, send it back to us for a full refund - no questions asked.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "lightbox_button_title_d8o7g654jdv_html": "* Terms & Conditions",
            "100daymoneybackguarantee_d8o7g654jdv_html": "100-day money back guarantee",
