            "textcontent_21o5ex9rkw6j_html": "<ul><li>The Phoenix Gravity Mini is easy to set up in under 10 minutes.\n<\/li><li>Housed in 304-grade stainless steel, naturally toxin-free, BPA-free, non-leaching.\n<\/li><li>Impregnated with silver to prevent bacteria growth.\n<\/li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with modern technology and the highest-grade environmentally friendly materials for the most effective, sustainable and durable filtration on the market.\n<br><\/li><\/ul>",
            "textcontent_fcg8fvq2dfd_html": "<ul><li>Perfect to travel with, holding up to 1L of spring-like water any time.\n<\/li><li>Activated three-stage carbon filters made from highest grade coconut shells (CTC 60), removes 99.99% of contaminants while preserving 100% of the nutrients your body needs.\n<\/li><li>Our cartridges use an activated carbon block that traps physical contaminants more than 20 times smaller than jug filters. \n<br><\/li><\/ul>",
            "headingtext_7wggpvb2b3y_html": "Designed for durability",
            "textcontent_0ioshksnajgv_html": " <ul><li>Unlike plastic filters, Phoenix Gravity\u2019s 304-grade stainless steel housing won\u2019t leach toxins, polyurethane, microplastics or harmful chemicals into your water.\n<\/li><li>Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of everyday use for 10+ years.\n<\/li><li>Our all-purpose activated carbon cartridges last up to two years. This means fewer replacements and lower cost per litre. \n<br><\/li><\/ul>",
