            "textcontent_o41lz187f0t_html": "Absolutely. The Phoenix Gravity Mini is designed for easy DIY set-up within minutes - no plumber, electricity or prior knowledge required. We\u2019ll send detailed instructions, along with instructions on how to prime your cartridge, with your Phoenix Gravity Mini.<div><br><\/div>",
            "textcontent_icztbf9rrkg_html": "Yes, it\u2019s simple! You can easily clean your filter in your home using tap water and a soft brush or mild abrasive. We\u2019ll include detailed instructions when we send your Phoenix Gravity Filter. \n<div><br><\/div>",
