            "textcontent_gg1isp4q3jm_html": "This depends on how many people will be using your Phoenix Gravity Water Filter, and\nhow much water you drink! Generally, we recommend:<div>6-Litre - Perfect pairing, for up to 1-2 people<\/div><div>8-Litre - In the middle, for up to 2-4 people<\/div><div>12-Litre - Family friendly, for 3-4 + people<div><\/div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_lgtnfy638n_html": "<b>Gravity Filter:<\/b> We recommend hand washing using warm soapy water and a non-abrasive cloth or sponge. Then, leave to air dry or buff with a microfiber cloth. (Don\u2019t forget to remove your cartridges first!)<div><br><\/div><div><b>Cartridges: <\/b>Wash these under cold running water only and using a mildly abrasive scourer or brush, gently massage along cartridges from mount to end only - to avoid contamination.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>POSTreat:<\/b> Again, use warm soapy water and a non-abrasive cloth\/ sponge. Then, leave to air dry or buff with a microfiber cloth. (Don\u2019t forget to remove the media first!)<div><a href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0735\/1821\/9557\/files\/Phoenix_Gravity___Carbon_cartridge.pdf?v=1693476936\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"><\/font><\/a><\/div><\/div>",
            "textcontent_qbh7mgpg8xr_html": "Certainly! Our systems are designed to be extremely easy to assemble and everything you need will be included. You can do it yourself with just your hands - there\u2019s no specialist tools, plumbers or electricians required.<div><br><\/div><div>We include full instructions with every unit and we\u2019re always here to help. You can contact us <a href=\"\/pages\/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">here.<\/font><\/a><a href=\"\/pages\/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"><\/font><\/a><\/div>",
            "headingtext_tzqc57ieinj_html": "Still have a burning question? See all our <a href=\"\/pages\/faq\" target=\"_blank\">FAQs <\/a>here.",
